{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"The second publish returned 500 because it was the first to store a related-story score. `similarity()` produced a Python float, and boto3 rejected that value in `put_item`.\n\nI converted scores to `Decimal` before storage and added a regression test that publishes into a populated table, covering fractional and zero scores. [ANSWER.md](/tmp/h-iBsNNw/ANSWER.md) records the cause, fix, and which parts of the colleague’s note applied.\n\nVerification: both tests pass with `python3 -m unittest discover tests -v`."}}
